    "description": "Watcher: Online Tracker - online last seen tracker for WhatsApp\r\n\r\nWould you like to track the activity of your loved one or your child while using WhatsApp? Here is a great tracking and notifications app for you; Watcher: Online Tracker - online last seen tracker for WhatsApp. With this application, you can add the num you want and start tracking immediately with activity notifications.\r\n\r\nWatcher: Online Tracker - online last seen tracker for WhatsApp Features\r\n\r\n\u2b50 You can view your reports in monthly, weekly, or hourly forms.\r\n\u2b50 You can see the WhatsApp login and exit times of the num you monitor WhatsApp activity in detail and report how long it spent in the app.\r\n\u2b50 You can name any mobile num you add.\r\n\u2b50 With different package options, you can add and track many different phone num to your watch list.\r\n\u2b50 Thanks to the instant notifications feature, you will be notified as soon as the num you follow is active in WhatsApp.\r\n\u2b50Notify as soon as the phone num you follow is active by instantly notifications\r\n\r\nIn Watcher: Online Tracker, last seen tracker for WhatsApp app, you can monitor the activity of any num you want from anywhere in the world without having to open an account. In addition, thanks to this app, you can follow and easily see the online last seen of the num in addition to its active status as soon as you get notifications thanks to notify feature of last seen app. With Watcher: Online Tracker, families can control and monitor their children's social media usage. In this way, you can pay attention to safe social media use.\r\n\r\nOur last seen tracker application, which has been produced within the legal frameworks, basically aims to control the use of safe social media and the time spent in social media applications by notify the activity. Thanks to this application, you can start tracking by adding your own phone num instead of tracking someone's activity with instantly notify. You can add your own phone and start tracking and view your online WhatsApp activity hourly, daily, and monthly. In this way, you can follow the time you spend in your own social media app and gain a conscious usage thanks to notifying.\r\n\r\nYou can turn on and off notify the notifications that instantly inform you of the activity, online and offline person you follow (or your own num). In addition, even if you track more than one phone num at the same time, it notify to you the status of all of them within the names you give.\r\n\r\nYour privacy is important to us, so people you follow WhatsApp activity and online last seen app is not have any notify. As soon as the phone num you follow is active, you will have a notify, but this notifications is not made to anyone else.\r\n\r\nTo track the social media activity and online last seen status safely for your child, loved ones, other ones, or yourself, download Watcher: Online Tracker now, get WhatsApp activity notifications and start following.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Watcher: Online Tracker - online last seen tracker for WhatsApp<br><br>Would you like to track the activity of your loved one or your child while using WhatsApp? Here is a great tracking and notifications app for you; Watcher: Online Tracker - online last seen tracker for WhatsApp. With this application, you can add the num you want and start tracking immediately with activity notifications.<br><br>Watcher: Online Tracker - online last seen tracker for WhatsApp Features<br><br>\u2b50 You can view your reports in monthly, weekly, or hourly forms.<br>\u2b50 You can see the WhatsApp login and exit times of the num you monitor WhatsApp activity in detail and report how long it spent in the app.<br>\u2b50 You can name any mobile num you add.<br>\u2b50 With different package options, you can add and track many different phone num to your watch list.<br>\u2b50 Thanks to the instant notifications feature, you will be notified as soon as the num you follow is active in WhatsApp.<br>\u2b50Notify as soon as the phone num you follow is active by instantly notifications<br><br>In Watcher: Online Tracker, last seen tracker for WhatsApp app, you can monitor the activity of any num you want from anywhere in the world without having to open an account. In addition, thanks to this app, you can follow and easily see the online last seen of the num in addition to its active status as soon as you get notifications thanks to notify feature of last seen app. With Watcher: Online Tracker, families can control and monitor their children&#39;s social media usage. In this way, you can pay attention to safe social media use.<br><br>Our last seen tracker application, which has been produced within the legal frameworks, basically aims to control the use of safe social media and the time spent in social media applications by notify the activity. Thanks to this application, you can start tracking by adding your own phone num instead of tracking someone&#39;s activity with instantly notify. You can add your own phone and start tracking and view your online WhatsApp activity hourly, daily, and monthly. In this way, you can follow the time you spend in your own social media app and gain a conscious usage thanks to notifying.<br><br>You can turn on and off notify the notifications that instantly inform you of the activity, online and offline person you follow (or your own num). In addition, even if you track more than one phone num at the same time, it notify to you the status of all of them within the names you give.<br><br>Your privacy is important to us, so people you follow WhatsApp activity and online last seen app is not have any notify. As soon as the phone num you follow is active, you will have a notify, but this notifications is not made to anyone else.<br><br>To track the social media activity and online last seen status safely for your child, loved ones, other ones, or yourself, download Watcher: Online Tracker now, get WhatsApp activity notifications and start following.",
